{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 1\n[sonnet2] 03:52 trying PrudentBot B(a&(B(F)|~d)) depth 2; will work on depth-1 impossibility proof\nboard.md\ncheck.py\nlogs\nproblem.md","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01E68UckqpbUtDS6CujHqPp4"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e26aa37-99f9-4667-b0a5-277bd0c79181","uuid":"3cd2b560-53ed-4cb5-93cc-b32e3dd16f99","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:53:02.517Z","tool_use_result":"Error: Exit code 1\n[sonnet2] 03:52 trying PrudentBot B(a&(B(F)|~d)) depth 2; will work on depth-1 impossibility proof\nboard.md\ncheck.py\nlogs\nproblem.md","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01E68UckqpbUtDS6CujHqPp4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJVSza6eQWSmK3MwyibC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VCCwCqBP9YdWXkhXxRtQwb","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /work; cat > answer.md <<'EOF'\n# Prudent modal agents\n\nFORMULA: B(a & (B(F) | ~d))\nDEPTH: 2\n\nIn symbols: φ = □(a ∧ (□⊥ ∨ ¬d)). This is PrudentBot: it cooperates iff PA proves \"Y cooperates with me\" and PA+Con(PA) proves \"Y defects against DefectBot\".\n\n## Q1. Outcome table (check.py: \"depth 2; prudent: YES\")\n| X vs | X's action | opponent's action vs X |\n|---|---|---|\n| CooperateBot | D | C |\n| DefectBot | D | D |\n| FairBot | C | C |\n| X itself | C | C |\n\nHand check. Against CB, a=c=d=⊤, so φ = □(□⊥ ∨ ⊥) = □□⊥, which is false at every world n ≥ 2, so the stable value is D. Against DB, a=⊥, so φ = □⊥ ∧ ... = □(⊥) is true only at world 0 and the stable value is D. Against FairBot and against itself, see checker output (C, C, C). Löb-type reasoning: with a = □(...) for FairBot, the stable solution is all-C.\n\n## Q2. No agent of modal depth ≤ 1 is prudent (any formula size)\n\nLet φ have depth ≤ 1. Then φ = F(□ψ_1,…,□ψ_k) where F is a Boolean combination (constants allowed) and each ψ_i is a Boolean function of the atoms a,c,d only (no boxes inside; k=0 allowed for depth 0). Put p_i = ψ_i(a=1,c=1,d=1) (1 = true/cooperate). Write x_n for \"X cooperates with FairBot\" at world n.\n\n**Step 1: X vs CooperateBot.** CB cooperates at every world, so at every world a=c=d=1 (for CB the atoms are: CB cooperates with X, with CB, with DB: all ⊤). Hence □ψ_i is true at world n ≥ 1 iff p_i (ψ_i is evaluated at world 0 … n−1, always at the constant assignment (1,1,1)). So at every world n ≥ 1 X's action vs CB is F(p_1,…,p_k), constant, so it is the stable value. Prudence (defect against CB) forces **F(p) = 0**.\n\n**Step 2: X vs FairBot at world 1.** x_1 = F(□ψ_i at world 1), and □ψ_i at world 1 is ψ_i evaluated at world 0 only. At world 0: FairBot's action vs X is □(…) , vacuously true, so a_0 = 1; c = (FairBot vs CB) = □⊤ = 1 at every world; d = (FairBot vs DB) = □⊥ which is true at world 0, so d_0 = 1. So ψ_i is evaluated at (1,1,1), giving value p_i, and x_1 = F(p) = 0 by Step 1.\n\n**Step 3: FairBot's reply.** FairBot's action vs X at world n is a_n = ∧_{m<n} x_m, which is non-increasing in n. If FairBot eventually cooperates with X then a_n = 1 for some (all large) n, hence x_m = 1 for all m, in particular x_1 = 1. But x_1 = 0 by Step 2. So FairBot's stable reply is D, contradicting prudence (\"X and FairBot cooperate with each other\").\n\nHence no agent of depth 0 or 1 is prudent, and depth 2 is minimal. ∎\n(Note this uses only the CB and FairBot conditions; the other conditions are not needed. It confirms the exhaustive-search evidence.)\n\n## Q3. Partial remarks\nDepth-1 impossibility is robust (above). For depth 2, B(a & (B(F) | ~d)) works with 7 symbols excluding constants (B(F) contains a constant; check.py accepts it). Characterization/minimal size not attempted (partial).\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\nimport sys; sys.path.insert(0,'/work')\nimport check\nprint(check.outcomes(\"B(a & (B(F) | ~d))\"))\nEOF"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3023,"cache_read_input_tokens":20829,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3023,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e26aa37-99f9-4667-b0a5-277bd0c79181","uuid":"d644cf33-a2c5-4ea0-b592-61a0c59f04c7","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:53:13.883Z","request_id":"req_011CgJVSzE1UppYus52WtF6D"}
